{
  "slug": "zapier",
  "name": "Zapier",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect 8,000+ apps to your AI workflow. Discover, enable, and execute Zapier actions directly from your client.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `zapier-demo` (Walk a new user through setting up their first Zapier action and running it live — the smallest…), `zapier-explore` (Explore what Zapier MCP can do for the user — interview them about their role and the apps…), `zapier-onboard` (Onboard a new user to Zapier MCP — introduce what it can do, walk through authentication, and route…), `zapier-status` (Check the health of your Zapier MCP setup)\n- **Agents** (1): `zapier-mcp.agent` (Uses Zapier MCP to discover, enable, audit, and execute app actions safely and efficiently while following Zapier's read/write…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `zapier`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install zapier@claude-plugins-official` from `zapier/zapier-mcp` (`plugins/zapier`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
